   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Responses travel back along the same path.  \ud83d\udd12 = requireAuth (Bearer JWT from localStorage tl-session).  \u2605 = new since the first diagram.  \u201cserver \u2192 server\u201d = the Next.js server calls Express directly.",
   "originalText": "Responses travel back along the same path.  \ud83d\udd12 = requireAuth (Bearer JWT from localStorage tl-session).  \u2605 = new since the first diagram.  \u201cserver \u2192 server\u201d = the Next.js server calls Express directly.",
